        "gg3Q-EJAmbA_text_732430752": "My Wife Noticed Before I Did",
        "ggHFmL5ZWt-_text_1891421265": "I'm 52 and this stuff has changed my mornings. I used to drag myself out of bed and grab two coffees before I could function. Now I'm up before my alarm. The energy is steady — no crash, no jitters. My wife noticed before I did.",
        "ggWJsXZSiV9_text_-1752832263": "— Michael R., 52, Austin TX &nbsp;✓&nbsp;",
        "ggx7-CgRErK_srcSet_desktop_src_-2003480384": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/9_6.webp?v=1771829434",
        "ggx7-CgRErK_srcSet_mobile_src_-2003480384": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/9_6.webp?v=1771829434",
        "ggMa0sSqlaB_text_837563184": "Two Weeks In and I Wasn't Looking Back",
        "ggX7yoRbm2P_text_-1837975594": "Was skeptical. Tried every testosterone booster on Amazon. Most did nothing. This is the first thing where I felt an actual difference in the bedroom AND at the gym. Two weeks in and I wasn't looking back",
        "ggPRl-q92Dv_text_-1351086135": "— James T., 46, Portland OR ✓",
        "ggng0OTGlYg_srcSet_desktop_src_760160695": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_nam_3.webp?v=1770883890",
        "ggng0OTGlYg_srcSet_mobile_src_760160695": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_nam_3.webp?v=1770883890",
        "ggNDby2WAAP_text_-1194768531": "The Fog Lifted. Then Everything Else Followed.",
        "ggg_U8b3Lel_text_-1633687929": "The brain fog is what got me. I'm a contractor and I need to be sharp on the job. After about 10 days on Shilajit I noticed I wasn't losing my train of thought. Focus came back. Bonus: my drive came back too.",
