        "ggy9QIT5srE_srcSet_desktop_src_2106401015": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/8_4.webp?v=1771829420",
        "ggy9QIT5srE_srcSet_mobile_src_1196150306": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/7_3.webp?v=1771829408",
        "gg7WmRxEFOJ_text_-1715430226": "I Bought It for Testosterone. I Stayed for the Sleep.",
        "gg4AUwGDLoQ_text_529286659": "Honestly? I bought this for the testosterone stuff. But the biggest change has been my sleep. I'm sleeping through the night and waking up actually rested. Everything else — energy, mood, performance — followed",
        "ggYcWhI1AOX_text_-956324770": "— Robert S., 55, Seattle WA ✓",
        "ggyG3ujh9o2_srcSet_desktop_src_1196150306": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/7_3.webp?v=1771829408",
        "ggyG3ujh9o2_srcSet_mobile_src_1118828970": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_nam_1.webp?v=1770883536",
        "ggsn2Pvtab9_text_-1712077097": "I Wasn't a Non-Responder. I Was a Scam Victim",
        "ggBG7qallq3_text_253374183": "I trusted influencers. Bought what they promoted. Defended it to my gym friends. \"You don't understand bioavailability!\" Then the testing came out. <strong>ZERO SHILASHIT.</strong> I wasn't a non-responder. I was a scam victim. ShilaSource shows their lab reports. My deadlift is up 25lbs. My trust in influencers is gone forever.",
        "ggRByv9lRXO_text_2126259842": "— Marcus D., 38, San Diego CA ✓",
        "ggC8utlRuvP_srcSet_desktop_src_1118828970": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_nam_1.webp?v=1770883536",
        "ggC8utlRuvP_srcSet_mobile_src_1196150306": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/7_3.webp?v=1771829408",
        "ggzzPVRvJln_text_-731634369": "Nothing Really. Just Genetics I Guess",
        "ggBsisfrCnJ_text_-1619799117": "Gary does curls in the squat rack. I looked him dead in his eyes and said \"nothing really, just genetics I guess.\" GARY LOOKED SO DEFEATED.",
        "ggwsIhEX9oG_text_1881055369": "<strong>—</strong> Troy W., 41, Boston MA <strong>✓</strong>",
        "ggW0IqaucdR_srcSet_desktop_src_-503742717": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_nam_2.webp?v=1770883536",
        "ggW0IqaucdR_srcSet_mobile_src_-503742717": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_nam_2.webp?v=1770883536",
        "ggMxfUFx6oa_text_-1971600169": "IT Flagged Our Slack Channel. Worth It.",
        "gggwpt215jT_text_-494454241": "KAREN DOESN'T EVEN WORK OUT. It's been 6 weeks. I have converted 11 coworkers to ShilaSource. We have a Slack channel called #gummygang. IT flagged it.",
        "ggmtv9AJPoh_text_1309334284": "— Karen B., 34, San Francisco CA ✓",
        "ggmOpCGQ2vL_srcSet_desktop_src_-457514846": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_n_2.webp?v=1770883536",
        "ggmOpCGQ2vL_srcSet_mobile_src_-457514846": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FuF_review_n_2.webp?v=1770883536",
        "ggcxKocrj4G_text_1722652576": "Karen Hit 135lbs on Squat. Karen Is 54. We Cried",
        "ggEmKSAVjJN_text_1009237941": "We were supposed to discuss \"Lessons in Chemistry.\" Instead I gave a PowerPoint on shilajit. Six weeks later, 7 members take ShilaSource. We have a group chat called \"Shelajit.\" <strong>Karen hit 135lbs on squat. KAREN IS 54. WE CRIED.</strong>",
        "ggpyLZ-ArMi_text_368900141": "— Michelle T., 42, Denver CO ✓",
        "gg73I4tJnBl_label_-1504204862": "TRY SHILASOURCE TODAY!",
        "ggtN0j9wmPK_childItem_0_90449432": "FREE Shipping For Orders Above $70",
