    "gp_global_section_619432705221722709-3": {
      "type": "gp-global-section-619432705221722709",
      "settings": {
        "section_preload": "false",
        "checksum": "",
        "ggkniwjg1Fr_text_-1357831877": "any last <i>questions?</i>",
        "ggdcoTbazk6_text_-1965990182": "ShilaSource is the first clean Himalayan Shilajit Resin that really works.",
        "gghICwHbGvV_label_-1504204862": "TRY SHILASOURCE TODAY!",
        "ggIQr6cuOI4_childItem_0_90449432": "FREE Shipping For Orders Above $70",
        "ggMBH7oYco4_childItem_0_-1472107715": "24/7 Customer Service",
        "ggiq7zJ_fAj_childItem_0_-972139690": "90-Day Money Back Guarantee",
        "ggIjn8cneWS_childItem_0_1538300980": "Over 137,235+ Happy Customers",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_0_95822718": "How is ShilaSource different from other Shilajit products",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_1_386861077": "Why resin form instead of gummies or capsules?",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_2_1256212862": "How long until I feel results?",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_3_-500057940": "Can I take this with my morning coffee?",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_4_780505951": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_5_46685245": "Is it third-party tested and authentic?",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_6_-183014602": "Will it interact with my medications?",
        "ggK27PSUNQ0_text_-406491758": "Most Shilajit products are filled with dust, fillers, or synthetic additives — and they don't publish lab reports. We triple-test every batch and publish full Certificates of Analysis. Our resin contains 75% verified Fulvic Acid, sourced from above 17,000 feet in the Himalayas.",
        "ggzyMOMHA9n_text_-1855801640": "Resin is the most bioavailable form of Shilajit. Capsules and gummies require binders and fillers that reduce absorption. One pea-sized scoop of resin delivers more active compound than a handful of pills.",
        "gg7jmTRUEzD_text_702200090": "Most men report noticeable energy and focus improvements within 7–14 days. Testosterone and sexual performance benefits typically become noticeable within 30–90 days of consistent daily use.",
        "ggUHrOh1j9E_text_291384550": "Yes. Simply stir one pea-sized scoop into warm coffee or tea. The heat helps dissolve the resin for easy absorption.",
        "ggD-NsRVdUC_text_-373596078": "We offer a full 90-day money back guarantee. If you don't feel a real difference, we'll refund every penny. No questions asked.",
        "gg6KCjI5kR7_text_-1906586361": "Every batch undergoes independent third-party testing for heavy metals, microbial contamination, and Fulvic Acid potency. Lab reports are published on our website.",
        "ggUWlKQpi93_text_1635152972": "Shilajit is generally well-tolerated. However, if you're on blood thinners, blood pressure medication, or any prescription drugs, we recommend consulting your doctor before starting."
      }
    },
    "gp_section_619431923789333297": {
      "type": "gp-section-619431923789333297",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "f0907ce3a99271f416bba2572b7f93c6e713739bbf1b00827fb1be53ce9c183b_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggfua_pm8Wk_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/10_6.webp?v=1771829620",
        "ggfua_pm8Wk_srcSet_tablet_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Mikey_Moretti_BJJ44.jpg",
        "gggVTGFOg8I_text": "<p>Mikey Moretti, The Mat Rat, BJJ Enthusiast</p>",
        "ggHzCQFrvID_text": "<strong>Superior Absorption — Resin Form Done Right</strong>",
        "gg08C9Euxgm_text": "<p>Most shilajit comes in capsules or gummies loaded with fillers. ShilaSource is pure resin. Just one pea-sized scoop dissolved in warm water, coffee, or tea delivers a clinical dose with maximum bioavailability. Your body actually absorbs what it needs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Modern soil depletion means most men are mineral deficient. ShilaSource delivers a full spectrum of 87+ trace minerals, vitamins, and amino acids in their natural, bioactive form — supporting everything from recovery and muscle function to hormonal balance and vitality.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is where ShilaSource stands apart. Every single batch is triple-tested by ISO 17025 accredited laboratories for heavy metals, microbial contamination, and Fulvic Acid concentration. Full Certificates of Analysis (COA) are published for every batch. No hidden fillers. No dust. No compromises.</p>",
        "ggMA1GEGE5X_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Mikey_Moretti.jpg",
        "ggMA1GEGE5X_srcSet_tablet_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Mikey_Moretti_BJJ44.jpg"
      }
    },
